haben"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"dog, hound","l":"Hund"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to wound","l":"verwunden"},{"g":"roe deer"},null]},{"text":"Die Hunde brauchten nicht lang, da hatten sie das verwundete Reh aufgespürt.","en":"The dogs took little time tracking down the wounded deer.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"dog, hound","l":"Hund"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"long"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to wound","l":"verwunden"},{"g":"roe deer"},null]}]}